@startuml
title Sequence Diagram Generate QR Code

actor "Dosen" as Dosen
participant "Frontend" as App
participant "Backend" as System
database "Database" as DB

Dosen -> App : Membuat sesi presensi
App -> System : Request generate QR Code

System -> DB : Simpan data sesi
DB --> System : Data tersimpan

System --> App : QR Code berhasil dibuat
App --> Dosen : Tampilkan QR Code

@enduml